<title>USA: Duckwall-Alco to acquire 14 locations.</title>
<headline>Duckwall-Alco to acquire 14 locations.</headline>
<dateline>ABILENE, Kan. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duckwall-ALCO Stores Inc said on Monday that it signed a definitive agreement to acquire 14 retail locations in Indiana and Ohio from Val Corp.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, the stores will be delivered to Duckwall by January 31, 1997. The company plans to remodel and stock the stores with inventory and open them as new ALCO stores over a 60 day period beginning March 1997.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
